#: processes/sdlc/code-quality-gates.bpmn:74
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Three checks: `bun run lint`, `tsc --noEmit` and `bun test`. The repository gates it used to carry are Task_RepositoryGates now (bean `om30`). Since bean `dlqu` it is three jobs: `typescript-static` (lint, then typecheck), `typescript-test` (`bun test` as four SEQUENTIAL shards on separate machines — Bun's in-process `--parallel` worker pool hung at both 4 and 2 workers, measured — the shard passed in `BUN_OPTIONS` so the command stays the one `bun run gates` runs locally) and `typescript`, which carries the check name and is green only when the other two succeeded. The step-order rule the single job needed — `bun test` LAST, because Actions stops at the first failing step and a red-by-decision test would otherwise mask lint and typecheck — no longer has anything to order: separate jobs cannot mask each other. Measured on three `main` runs before the change: `bun test` alone was 7m30s-7m45s of an 8m14s-8m33s job."
msgstr ""

